        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"51c6827a-b07a-4e55-895e-bf6eb19a5a7d\",\"review_text\":\"Very great 👍\"},{\"review_id\":\"c4cf35b2-e85f-446e-811a-e224fd0861a3\",\"review_text\":\"This is a very very poor app of all time don't waste your data🤬\"},{\"review_id\":\"e7445c5d-0bc0-447b-b56e-a6f499e8d3f3\",\"review_text\":\"Good app ...the best thing is it doesn't takes data i.e it don't take any storage .... Which is great for me\"},{\"review_id\":\"59724777-26a2-4ca6-9208-b45f52ae7b58\",\"review_text\":\"I love this app,and it doesn't give that much ad,\"},{\"review_id\":\"fafbd439-2426-4bf5-b79a-cd00a32b1f43\",\"review_text\":\"Constantly having to clear the cache in Spotify to make it stream song info in my car, otherwise it just says \\\"Spotify isn't working\\\". Google Nest speakers and Echo speakers constantly get confused when the app is open on my phone and will fail to play, sometimes playing 1 second it a song, and then pausing, until I tell it to play and it finally complies. Makes casting pointless. Never used to exhibit these behaviors. Just awful. Tempted to try YouTube music.\"},{\"review_id\":\"34ed6f9a-7527-4ca4-9dda-c395422178a6\",\"review_text\":\"My music the music I didn't buy back in the day.\"},{\"review_id\":\"7bd4abd7-023f-4bdd-8fd2-fc6a404f9ea7\",\"review_text\":\"Why do podcasts buffer a lot while listening to music is continuous. Only in podcasts do I experience constant buffering every 10 seconds or so\"},{\"review_id\":\"a2d7b26f-53f1-48b1-b0e7-36aa107d7949\",\"review_text\":\"Terbaik\"},{\"review_id\":\"f52c41c3-e533-4d98-bb3a-2ab97548c126\",\"review_text\":\"But pulse.more music gendra\"},{\"review_id\":\"ed610e9b-1cfd-4e14-a801-51eb543fcfc0\",\"review_text\":\"Bro just make this app premium to even download at this point. 😭\"}]}"
